<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tech Data started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tech Data started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell analyst Steven Fortuna said he initiated coverage of Tech Data Corp with an accumulate rating and 12-15 month price target of $33-$35.</p>
<p>-- He said earnings per share estimates for fiscal years 1997, 1998 and 1999 were $1.22, $1.47 and $1.80, respectively.</p>
<p>-- He said that the computing products distribution company was well-positined to benefit from industry consolidation.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1/8 at 28-1/2.</p>
</text>
